    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"kevinrhaas\"} -->\n_Requested by **Kevin** \u00b7 [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01XPwihxLZTCL4xqRww9mX5v?thread=cmsg_01XPwihxLZTCL4xqRww9mX5v11E8tKusbyKtcmRytW56DG)_\n\n## Why\n\nSmoke desktop part 14 after T-3017 (#1199): \"the frame at the 1904 spawn is inside the draw budget (T-1739)\" failed, **4,603,239** triangles against 4,600,000.\n\nMeasured at the spawn on one published build (`a.stats()` as the smoke reads it):\n\n| | frame triangles | street trees |\n|---|---|---|\n| dev before T-3017 | 4,482,761 | 200,900 |\n| dev after T-3017 | 4,603,239 | 302,902 |\n| this PR | **4,568,155** | 270,222 |\n\nThe spawn sees 1 near, 23 mid, 500 far and 2,630 distant elms. Per template (mean of 6 seeds) the vase elm's far level was 90 wood + 184 leaf triangles against the timber elm's 71 + 51, so the far ring carried most of the growth (+76k).\n\n## What changed\n\n`ELM_SHARE.far` 0.05 \u2192 0.03 (`tree-model.js`): elms past 44 m draw 3 % of their clumps, each card scaled by 1/\u221ashare to carry the same leaf (far leaf 184 \u2192 110 triangles a tree). The mid level (10-44 m, what a walker sees down the file) keeps 0.62; a trial at 0.5 visibly thinned the street, so it stays. The phone tier (`ELM_SHARE_COARSE`) is untouched.\n\nA far-row A/B render in the tree viewer shows the crowns' mass unchanged.\n\n## Gate\n\n- `tools/check.sh`: CHECK PASS (1046 steps).\n- `changelog-entries --check`: OK (`changelog.d/T-3032.json`).\n- Smoke desktop part 14 (the part that failed) running locally; result follows in a comment.\n\n---\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01NTdiK3nVcVcmWAnmkgmfQj)_",
